OL,4,Aglobal cyber-security warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmazon was targeted in multiple
OL,7,Fattempts, which it said occurred before
OL,8,Fan embargo on the warning was lifted.
OL,9,FIt added that it was unclear how actors
OL,10,Fknew about the vulnerabilities.
